{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createRoute"},{"type":"text","value":" function implements returns a "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Route"}]},{"type":"text","value":" instance. A route instance can then be passed to a root route's children to create a route tree, which is then passed to the router."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"createroute-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createRoute options"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteOptions"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options that will be used to configure the route instance"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"createroute-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createRoute returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A new "},{"type":"link","href":"./RouteType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Route"}]},{"type":"text","value":" instance."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { rootRoute } from './__root'\n\nconst Route = createRoute({\n  getParentRoute: () => rootRoute,\n  path: '/',\n  loader: () => {\n    return 'Hello World'\n  },\n  component: IndexComponent,\n})\n\nfunction IndexComponent() {\n  const data = Route.useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{data}</div>\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"createroute-options","text":"createRoute options","level":2},{"id":"createroute-returns","text":"createRoute returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `createRoute` function implements returns a [`Route`](./RouteType.md) instance. A route instance can then be passed to a root route's children to create a route tree, which is then passed to the router.\n\n## createRoute options\n\n- Type: [`RouteOptions`](./RouteOptionsType.md)\n- Required\n- The options that will be used to configure the route instance\n\n## createRoute returns\n\nA new [`Route`](./RouteType.md) instance.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { createRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { rootRoute } from './__root'\n\nconst Route = createRoute({\n  getParentRoute: () => rootRoute,\n  path: '/',\n  loader: () => {\n    return 'Hello World'\n  },\n  component: IndexComponent,\n})\n\nfunction IndexComponent() {\n  const data = Route.useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{data}</div>\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createRouteFunction\ntitle: createRoute function\n---\n\nThe `createRoute` function implements returns a [`Route`](./RouteType.md) instance. A route instance can then be passed to a root route's children to create a route tree, which is then passed to the router.\n\n## createRoute options\n\n- Type: [`RouteOptions`](./RouteOptionsType.md)\n- Required\n- The options that will be used to configure the route instance\n\n## createRoute returns\n\nA new [`Route`](./RouteType.md) instance.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { createRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { rootRoute } from './__root'\n\nconst Route = createRoute({\n  getParentRoute: () => rootRoute,\n  path: '/',\n  loader: () => {\n    return 'Hello World'\n  },\n  component: IndexComponent,\n})\n\nfunction IndexComponent() {\n  const data = Route.useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{data}</div>\n}\n```\n"}
